person "==Developer\n<size:16>[Person]</size>\n\nWrites a program that uses the XIAO's sensors." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxQZXJzb24=>> as Developer
rectangle "==On-board sensors\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nLSM6DS3TR-C IMU (accelerometer + gyroscope) and PDM microphone, soldered on the board." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as Onboardsensors

rectangle "xiao-nrf52840-sensors\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-eGlhby1ucmY1Mjg0MC1zZW5zb3Jz>> {
  rectangle "==Firmware\n<size:16>[Container: Rust binary, no_std, flashed with scripts/flash.sh (crates/firmware)]</size>\n\nRuns on the XIAO; powers and reads the sensors the API asks for, sends the readings back." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware
  rectangle "==Proto\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library, no_std (crates/proto)]</size>\n\nThe messages the API and the firmware exchange, and how they become bytes. Built into both, so they cannot disagree." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.Proto
  rectangle "==API\n<size:16>[Container: Rust library, runs off the board (crates/api)]</size>\n\nWhat the developer calls: pick sensors, configure them, read them. Talks to the firmware." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXI=>> as xiaonrf52840sensors.API
}

Developer --> xiaonrf52840sensors.API <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Picks sensors, reads them"
xiaonrf52840sensors.API --> xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Sends commands, receives readings\n<size:16>[USB, BLE, UART]</size>"
xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware --> Onboardsensors <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Powers, configures, reads"
xiaonrf52840sensors.API --> xiaonrf52840sensors.Proto <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Speaks"
xiaonrf52840sensors.Firmware --> xiaonrf52840sensors.Proto <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Speaks"

@enduml